(7760685, 1285438, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great low light.  One could say the dumpster and the wires are a bit distracting, but they are there, right?  That''s what we see.</td>', 'Great low light.  One could say the dumpster and the wires are a bit distracting, but they are there, right?  That''s what we see.', '2023-12-04 18:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
