(7760712, 1285373, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog is grate eveloshinary byologist, catched famus nuthatch. Nuts not hatch no mattur how much Grog make burd sit on them. Grog think that must have been day that Grog skippeded byology class.</td>', 'Grog is grate eveloshinary byologist, catched famus nuthatch. Nuts not hatch no mattur how much Grog make burd sit on them. Grog think that must have been day that Grog skippeded byology class.', '2023-12-04 21:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760713, 1285414, 83313, '<td valign="top">"She walks through the corn leading down to the river,  Her hair shone like gold in the hot morning sun, She took all the love that a poor boy could give her, And left me to die like a <a href="https://youtu.be/8KuQILn2L2A?si=rC2ror9doVkQwMr8" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">fox on the run</a>"<br/> <br/>That''s what popped into my head upon seeing this. Bringing up a song I haven''t heard in decades is worth some extra pointage, but "Fox on the run" may have been a better title.</td>', '"She walks through the corn leading down to the river,  Her hair shone like gold in the hot morning sun, She took all the love that a poor boy could give her, And left me to die like a fox on the run" That''s what popped into my head upon seeing this. Bringing up a song I haven''t heard in decades is worth some extra pointage, but "Fox on the run" may have been a better title.', '2023-12-04 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760722, 1285439, 124815, '<td valign="top">I simply love your cat and mouse stories Wendy. I have two comments if I may be so bold to express them to you:<br/>- Moriarty needs just a wee more light<br/>- The rolling pin is too much of a distraction. I''d keep onions and egg shells only on the beautifully floured table<br/>- keep the story simple</td>', 'I simply love your cat and mouse stories Wendy. I have two comments if I may be so bold to express them to you:- Moriarty needs just a wee more light- The rolling pin is too much of a distraction. I''d keep onions and egg shells only on the beautifully floured table- keep the story simple', '2023-12-05 10:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
